## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Local configuration — never commit real credentials
##
## db.php is created from db.example.php and holds database credentials.
## See SECURITY.md for the incident history behind this rule.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
db.php
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Compiled C output
##
## `prog` (an x86-64 ELF binary) was committed to this repository. Build
## artifacts do not belong in version control — build from source instead:
##     make            (see docs/BUILD.md)
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
prog
tri_eleves
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.out
a.out
*.exe
*.gch
*.dSYM/

## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Real personal data
##
## Students.csv in this repository is an ANONYMISED fixture. The file
## originally contained names, birth dates, home addresses and phone numbers
## of 41 real students and was public from 2024 to 2026 — see SECURITY.md.
## Never replace it with real data; keep real datasets outside the repository.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Students.local.csv
students.real.csv
*.private.csv

